 "text": "Interactive Property Maps | Lincoln County, SD\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nAbout Us\nDepartments\nGovernment\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nInteractive Property Maps\nHome\nDepartments\nPlanning & Zoning\nGeographic Information Services\nInteractive Property Maps\nInteractive Property Maps\nParcel Browser\nProperty Sales\nProperty Information Portal\nNote\nIn order to deliver the most current mapping we must upgrade our services periodically. You may not be able to access your bookmarked links to individual maps. Be sure to bookmark this page rather than individual maps to insure continued access.\nDisclaimer\nData for these maps is in a continual state of update and correction. Mapped data shown in these applications may need further substantiation and interpretation; therefore it is to be used for reference only. Lincoln County offers no warranty of any kind, expressed or implied. This data does not constitute a legal survey nor does it constitute official validity. For documentation of real property, consult the Register of Deeds office at the Lincoln County Courthouse.\nBids & RFPs\nEmployment\nVoter Information\nProperty Tax\nInteractive Maps\nAgendas & Minutes\nContact Us\nLincoln County Courthouse\n104 N Main Street\nCanton, SD 57013\nContact Us\n8:00 am – 5:00 pm\nMonday - Friday ( Excluding Holidays )\nImportant Links\nCommission\nElections\nGIS\nMarriage Licenses\nSheriff\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nBESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy\nClose ×",
